          "text": "🇺🇸🇻🇪 The U.S. military operation in Venezuela is a dangerous breach of the UN Charter.\nChange can only come through an inclusive, democratic process led by Venezuelans. \nPES President Stefan Löfven stated: \"Using military force against a sovereign country without a UN mandate - clearly in pursuit of regime change - jeopardises the very principles upon which the world was rebuilt after WWII. Our appeal to uphold international law and the UN Charter is not mere rhetoric; it is a call to protect the very foundations of diplomacy and constructive international relationships.\""
